#3: Farmers Markets – Orlando boasts many dog friendly farmers markets every weekend. From Wind[erm]ere[�]�s Friday Farmers Market to the big Saturday markets in Winter Garden and Winter Park – you are hard pressed to find a locale without a marketplace of fresh produce. Dogs at these events have become so prominent that many[ vendors] now cater exclusively to dogs selling homemade biscuits and treats just for your pooch.
#2: The beach – Contrary to popular belief there ARE several dog[ friendly] beaches within a short drive of[ Orlando]. The closest is the Smyr[na] Dunes Park[.] Dogs can romp and play in the sun alongside your family.
