> As the co-founder of Lonely Planet, Tony Wheeler has inspired generations of[ int]repid[ travellers] to[ explore] the four corners of the planet. But in an age where travel is more accessible than ever, what does it really mean to have been ‘everywhere’? Join Tony as he reflects on the most accomplished adventurers he knows, the unticked destinations on his wish list, and the challenges and rewards of visiting some of the world’s more[ remote] and[ difficult] destinations.

